# Design language — homepage is source of truth

When building or refactoring marketing pages, match the homepage. Use shared primitives; do not invent one-off radius or heading styles.

## Primitives

| Import | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `@/lib/design-tokens` | `headingClass`, `radius` |
| `@/components/ui/section` | Page width + padding (`max-w-[84rem]`) |
| `@/components/ui/section-header` | Eyebrow + section title + optional body |
| `@/components/ui/surface` | Cards (`card`), banners (`panel`), callouts (`callout`), pills (`pill`) |
| `@/components/ui/eyebrow` | Section labels |

## Typography roles

| Role | Token | Use |
|------|-------|-----|
| Hero title | `headingClass.hero` (`type-h3`) | Page heroes |
| Section title | `headingClass.section` (`type-h4`) | Eyebrow-led sections |
| Subsection | `headingClass.subsection` (`type-h5`) | Callouts, sticky sidebar titles |
| Card title | `headingClass.card` (`type-h6`) | Cards, feature items |

Section headings are always full `text-text` (black). Never split a title into black + grey spans. Line breaks via `\n` + `MultilineText` or `<SectionHeader>`.

## Border radius

Use `radius` from design-tokens — not `rounded-lg`, `rounded-2xl`, or `rounded-3xl`.

| Token | Class | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `radius.xs` | `rounded-xs` | Dark callout cards |
| `radius.sm` | `rounded-sm` | Cards, panels, wide banners |
| `radius.full` | `rounded-full` | Pills, chips, avatars |

Wide colored banners: `<Section wide>` + `<Surface variant="panel">` (stats / security pattern).

## New pages checklist

1. Wrap sections in `<Section>` (not raw `max-w-[1200px] px-6`)
2. Section intros via `<SectionHeader>` with `headingRole="section"`
3. Cards via `<Surface variant="card">`
4. Booking CTAs via `meetingUrl` + `meetingLabel` from `siteSettings.sharedLinks`
